{"neofx":2,"id":"slice_glitch","name":"Slice Glitch","category":"Glitch","params":[{"id":"slices","name":"Slices","min":4,"max":40,"default":14},{"id":"shift","name":"Shift","min":0,"max":0.3,"default":0.08},{"id":"rate","name":"Speed","min":1,"max":20,"default":8}],"shader":"float rnd(float x) { return fract(sin(x * 91.345) * 47453.5453); } vec4 effect(vec2 uv) { float row = floor(uv.y * slices); float t = floor(time * rate); float on = step(0.6, rnd(row * 7.13 + t)); float o = (rnd(row + t * 3.7) - 0.5) * shift * on; return texture2D(image, vec2(uv.x + o, uv.y)); }"}
